{"id":"ca928a31eb017424","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-projection.md","title":"df-context-projection","display":"df-context-projection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-projection","aliases":["16-df-projection","Context projection"],"display":"df-context-projection","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-type-total-space]]","[[16-df-dependent-term]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Section 0.2, pp. 14–17 (PDF 34–37); Section 10.5, pp. 625–626 (PDF 645–646)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-projection</span><span>Context projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-projection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce03b6c98313aa1a\" href=\"?note=ce03b6c98313aa1a\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type-total-space\">16-df-dependent-type-total-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9cb3cc51e30a056\" href=\"?note=c9cb3cc51e30a056\" title=\"16-df-dependent-term\">16-df-dependent-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 0.2, pp. 14–17 (PDF 34–37); Section 10.5, pp. 625–626 (PDF 645–646)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本页为集合模型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为小集合族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A\">\\(\\pi_A\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ce03b6c98313aa1a\" href=\"?note=ce03b6c98313aa1a\" title=\"16-df-dependent-type-total-space\">16-df-dependent-type-total-space</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9cb3cc51e30a056\" href=\"?note=c9cb3cc51e30a056\" title=\"16-df-dependent-term\">16-df-dependent-term</a> 的截面定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A\">\\(a:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A\\)</span> 是候选函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\\)</span> 是代入函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\sigma,A}\">\\(q_{\\sigma,A}\\)</span> 在下文构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a> 在集合范畴中的含义。</li>\n<li>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；所引依赖类型/项定义的环境宇宙取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、码集取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal U^\\Gamma\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal U^\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Delta)\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Delta)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi_A(\\gamma,x)&amp;=\\gamma,\\\\\na\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi_A\\circ a=\\operatorname{id}_{\\Gamma},\\\\\nA[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\circ\\sigma,\\\\\nq_{\\sigma,A}:\\Delta.A[\\sigma]&amp;\\longrightarrow\\Gamma.A,\n\\qquad q_{\\sigma,A}(\\delta,x)\\coloneqq(\\sigma\\delta,x),\\\\\n\\pi_A\\circ q_{\\sigma,A}&amp;=\\sigma\\circ\\pi_{A[\\sigma]},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(q_{\\sigma,A},\\pi_{A[\\sigma]};\\pi_A,\\sigma)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi_A(\\gamma,x)&amp;=\\gamma,\\\\\na\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi_A\\circ a=\\operatorname{id}_{\\Gamma},\\\\\nA[\\sigma]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\circ\\sigma,\\\\\nq_{\\sigma,A}:\\Delta.A[\\sigma]&amp;\\longrightarrow\\Gamma.A,\n\\qquad q_{\\sigma,A}(\\delta,x)\\coloneqq(\\sigma\\delta,x),\\\\\n\\pi_A\\circ q_{\\sigma,A}&amp;=\\sigma\\circ\\pi_{A[\\sigma]},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(q_{\\sigma,A},\\pi_{A[\\sigma]};\\pi_A,\\sigma)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>依赖项已按上游定义为截面，因而不能再次把它放入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\operatorname{id},a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\operatorname{id},a\\rangle\\)</span> 的第二分量。若用元素值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_2\">\\(a_2\\)</span> 表示项，其截面才是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\mapsto(\\gamma,a_2\\gamma)\">\\(\\gamma\\mapsto(\\gamma,a_2\\gamma)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>拉回的介体对满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Ar=\\sigma s\">\\(\\pi_Ar=\\sigma s\\)</span> 的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:T\\to\\Gamma.A,s:T\\to\\Delta\">\\(r:T\\to\\Gamma.A,s:T\\to\\Delta\\)</span> 唯一为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\mapsto(s(t),\\operatorname{pr}_2(r(t)))\">\\(t\\mapsto(s(t),\\operatorname{pr}_2(r(t)))\\)</span>。这也证明上式的拉回泛性质，不把依赖族与一般语法判断无条件等同。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §0.2, pp. 14–17（PDF 34–37）及 §10.5, pp. 625–626（PDF 645–646）的集合族模型；本页显式展开集合 pullback。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-type-total-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce03b6c98313aa1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-type-total-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-term","status":"resolved","id":"c9cb3cc51e30a056","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-type-total-space","status":"resolved","id":"ce03b6c98313aa1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本页为集合模型；$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为集合，$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族。$\\Gamma.A$、$\\pi_A$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-type-total-space]]，$\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-term]] 的截面定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-term","status":"resolved","id":"c9cb3cc51e30a056","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本页为集合模型；$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 为集合，$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族。$\\Gamma.A$、$\\pi_A$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-type-total-space]]，$\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)$ 采用 [[16-df-dependent-term]] 的截面定义。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A$ 是候选函数，$\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma$ 是代入函数。$A[\\sigma]$ 与 $q_{\\sigma,A}$ 在下文构造；$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]] 在集合范畴中的含义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\sigma,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)=\\mathcal U^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A[\\sigma]\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\pi_A(\\gamma,x)&=\\gamma,\\\\\na\\in\\mathsf{Tm}(\\Gamma,A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\pi_A\\circ a=\\operatorname{id}_{\\Gamma},\\\\\nA[\\sigma]&\\coloneqq A\\circ\\sigma,\\\\\nq_{\\sigma,A}:\\Delta.A[\\sigma]&\\longrightarrow\\Gamma.A,\n\\qquad q_{\\sigma,A}(\\delta,x)\\coloneqq(\\sigma\\delta,x),\\\\\n\\pi_A\\circ q_{\\sigma,A}&=\\sigma\\circ\\pi_{A[\\sigma]},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathbf{Set}}(q_{\\sigma,A},\\pi_{A[\\sigma]};\\pi_A,\\sigma)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle\\operatorname{id},a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\mapsto(\\gamma,a_2\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Ar=\\sigma s","display":false},{"tex":"r:T\\to\\Gamma.A,s:T\\to\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"t\\mapsto(s(t),\\operatorname{pr}_2(r(t)))","display":false}],"bytes":2336,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1965295379dd836","anch